  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegan butter in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the red lentils and 2 cups of water to the saucepan, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes, or until the lentils are tender.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh parsley and mint.",
    "Warm the corn husk by wrapping it in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds.",
    "Spoon the lentil mixture onto the center of the warmed corn husk.",
    "Fold the bottom half of the corn husk up over the filling, then fold in the sides and roll the wrap up tightly.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
